	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE D2:\n• +/-9 V sets the buffer ceiling (D-01): 1.188 V x (1 + 66.5k / 10k) = 9.09 V (9.00-9.27 V)\n• Changing R3-R6 changes the zener-open current ceiling (9.15 mA): re-check D-01 first"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
