	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE D1:\n• +5V (U4, ADC AVDD) and +3V3 (U5, isolator side 2, ADC / DAC logic) are TPS7A4901 as U2\n• Fed from U1 +12V since 2026-11-18 (VBAT is now on the FPGA-side GND): dissipation 0.11 / 0.22 W at 12.24 V [H]\n• FB: R7/R8 and R9/R10 by the D-01 method; 10 nF NR/SS, 10 uF X5R in and out as for U2 / U3\n• LCSC numbers for 32.4k / 17.8k 0603 to confirm (TBD in the fields)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 68.58 190.5 0)
		(size 62 23.495)
